### ============================================================================
### TPI FOOD STORE — PRUEBAS DE AUTENTICACIÓN Y USUARIOS (/api/v1)
### Requisito previo: haber ejecutado `python -m app.db.seed`
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### 1. Registro público de nuevo cliente (201 Created, rol "user")
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luciagomez",
  "full_name": "Lucía Gómez",
  "email": "lucia.gomez@foodstore.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Error 409 Conflict — Registro con username duplicado
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "luciagomez",
  "full_name": "Otra Lucía",
  "email": "otra.lucia@foodstore.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Error 409 Conflict — Registro con email duplicado (distinto username)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "lucia2",
  "full_name": "Lucía Dos",
  "email": "lucia.gomez@foodstore.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. Error 422 — Registro con contraseña corta (< 8 caracteres)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "pedrocorto",
  "full_name": "Pedro Corto",
  "email": "pedro@foodstore.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### 5. Login como Administrador del seed (200 OK + Cookie HttpOnly access_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=Admin1234!

### 6. Error 401 — Login con credenciales incorrectas
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=PasswordIncorrecta

### 7. Consultar perfil del usuario autenticado (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 8. Listar todos los usuarios (Solo admin -> 200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios

### 9. Error 400 — El admin intenta desactivarse a sí mismo (ID 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/1/desactivar

### 10. Desactivar usuario cliente con ID 2 (Solo admin -> 200 OK, disabled=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/2/desactivar

### 11. Activar usuario cliente con ID 2 (Solo admin -> 200 OK, disabled=false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/2/activar

### 12. Error 404 — Activar usuario inexistente
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/usuarios/9999/activar

### 13. Cerrar sesión (200 OK, borra la cookie access_token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout